an be written as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{5\\cdot (-1)-(-2)\\cdot 2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{-1}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-12284" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "810204698a78ba1cb5afaa72b36bf511cb2fa072080f2ad972c8d6a4ce865887"} {"question" "q-12284" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-12284" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "x=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-12284" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-320804" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-2x=6 \\\\ -3x+4y=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | $4$ | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $-2$ |  | |  |  |  | |  | $6$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-5$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $4$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $-2$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $6$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-5$ |  |  |  |  |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-320804" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{-2\\cdot 4-(-3)\\cdot 0}[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{8}[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{8}[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-320804" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "810204698a78ba1cb5afaa72b36bf511cb2fa072080f2ad972c8d6a4ce865887"} {"question" "q-320804" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-320804" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{1}{8}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa0713a6e1cbcdd82a28ca32b227b8041dd7ed52a6616eced2210071e1"} {"question" "q-320804" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13995674/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee7d97fa